<title>FRANCE: Castorama H1 pre-exceptional profit up.</title>
<headline>Castorama H1 pre-exceptional profit up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attrib before exceptionals	 179.4  vs	   164.5</p>
<p>    Turnover, taxes included	     8,535    vs	 7,716</p>
<p>NOTE - Castorama issued its first-half results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said profit before exceptionals rose nine percent and turnover rose 10.6 percent in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>Turnover, taxes included, was up 10.8 percent in the first eight months of the year.</p>
<p>Castorama said it was planning to open two 10,000 square metre stores in 1997 in Warsaw and Sao Paolo.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
